.TH BURN 1
.SH NAME
burn \- burn a work to admit another
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B burn
.I ID
.I FILE
.RB [ \-s
.IR FILE ]
.RB [ \-i ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Removes work
.I ID
from the library and admits
.I FILE
in its place. Same as
.B admit
.I FILE
.B \-b
.IR ID .
.PP
The burned work remains in its author's cell.
.SH FILES
/chapter/burnlog
.SH SEE ALSO
admit(1)
